# WIT dependencies are fetched, not vendored.
# `wash wit fetch` repopulates them from wkg.lock, which IS committed — the
# lock pins each dependency by digest, so a fetch reproduces the exact tree
# without carrying thousands of lines of someone else's WIT in this repo.
wit/deps/
